    "speaker": "VEGA",
    "lang": "en",
    "filename": "vega_en_7a6521dcc0102e1c754a.mp3",
    "canonicalText": "Do you know what the difference is between a dream and a tragedy, Orion? A few kilograms of thrust. In school they teach you that space is silent and beautiful. A lie. Space is a freezing beast waiting for you to make one calculation error to devour you. I lost my best friends up there because we trusted blueprints that had no margin for error."
