    "filename": "vega_en_1bd74c256a3bb23be1be.mp3",
    "canonicalText": "Cadet Orion, look at the top-left panel. Those 5 bars are your ship’s vital signs: Mass, Power, Budget, Data, and RF Link. Every piece you touch will move them. Click \"Understand & Continue\" to touch your first part."
