    "speaker": "VEGA",
    "lang": "en",
    "filename": "vega_en_2f041b4feaac35d62691.mp3",
    "canonicalText": "Look at STEP 1 · CHASSIS on the left. It is the aluminum body where instruments fit. Click any size (1.5U, 2U, or CUSTOM) right now—I will detect your move and show you how the center hologram changes!"
