    "lang": "en",
    "filename": "vega_en_7d7bc0a2a1a6e39a24ba.mp3",
    "canonicalText": "Inspectors are in the glass gallery, Orion. Check all 5 V&V boxes on the left, set the RF timer ≥30 min, and hold the fingerprint button on the right to sign the MCR!"
