    "speaker": "ROSTOVA",
    "lang": "en",
    "filename": "rostova_en_1b5d9910443981c824aa.mp3",
    "canonicalText": "There are no pretty metaphors about mountain backpacks here, Engineer Vanguard. At 600 million kilometers from Earth, a 0.1 decibel error in the radio link means data will be lost in cosmic noise. Vega told me you have talent. I only believe in what withstands the laws of thermodynamics. Design a Europa-class deep space probe. No concessions. No excuses."
