    "lang": "en",
    "filename": "system_en_43f6ca79ef370faf41c0.mp3",
    "canonicalText": "Orbital insertion around Europa confirmed. The Icarus-1 emergency beacon has responded! One hundred percent of the crew’s final black-box recordings and Europa subsurface ocean spectrograms are now streaming to Earth."
