    "filename": "vega_en_a7007813cf4dffa867f0.mp3",
    "canonicalText": "You brought them home, Vanguard... My God, you gave them a worthy finale. I promised Cadet Orion we would never fail again, and today Chief Engineer Vanguard fulfilled that promise. I will never forget what you did today."
